na&_nc_gid=tL5DRRWrTOYlEWM8EDqbQA&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQRd-bzK0lfu38BdhwmZApDc6ON2EijvzO7lzz6i64tbig&oe=6AF82C7A", "width": 1080, "height": 1080, "id": "11", "resolution": "1080x1080"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/899340458_18148776415570984_1640002502426816968_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyNjQyNDczODk4Njk1NzkwNA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=4Vv5aShK3Y8Q7kNvwHO7ptL&_nc_oc=AdrrDpFsbdBxBMxLjh8ebZvzDri2gc2QKB9CUE9KzMIPaE_8iPmNnypva7GSd_V62DIjS82jA2RV-2yULSsni59R&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna&_nc_gid=tL5DRRWrTOYlEWM8EDqbQA&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQStrSz4K47A2Q6IOQDGVripXP_zaImItsmQ9NRx7cyR7w&oe=6AF82C7A", "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "id": "12", "resolution": "1080x1920"}], "comments": [{"author": "xgnerva_", "author_id": "77763097163", "id": "18126942334920603", "text": "Its still insane to even think how they made such a character like Athena the Godesses of Wisdom. Seriously every action of her speaks opposite..", "timestamp": 1794253046, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "gothic_unicorn13", "author_id": "78426772060", "id": "18346407691256238", "text": "It totally makes sense that Athena is an oldest daughter 🫠 The family warrior has to carry it all. And of course, she has to grow up immediately.", "timestamp": 1794252329, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "elis.starry_night", "author_id": "54675913484", "id": "17978343159149941", "text": "you lnow what they say, like father like son, instead of children he swallowed the mother of his child🙃", "timestamp": 1794235414, "like_count": 9}, {"author": "almostpreh", "author_id": "59603524257", "id": "18039110036850354", "text": "I absolutely abhor Athena. This was nothing considering it's her, I understand, but God, her atrocities are boundless.", "timestamp": 1794234266, "like_count": 4}, {"author": "galileothephilisopher", "author_id": "77812629838", "id": "18454501747192462", "text": "So much for credit", "timestamp": 1794212011, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "chaotic_.darl", "author_id": "64603837198", "id": "18037472132893377", "text": "He did the same thing his father did to Zeus's entire family TO THE ONE WHO SAVED HIS FAMILY. I don't see what's so honourable about being such a king.", "timestamp": 1794209692, "like_count": 192}, {"author": "nadiaaaa__reh", "author_id": "23813041146", "id": "18060173354646677", "text": "Did athena know her mother was still inside? Considering she was born there also what happened to mertis after?", "timestamp": 1794209646, "like_count": 66}, {"author": "mythospaths", "author_id": "17131274983", "id": "18376940752300949", "text": "Which myth or a true story should I cover next? Drop your pick in the comments! If yours gets chosen, I’ll feature you in the video and shout you out! 💌", "timestamp": 1794207616, "like_count": 20}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfgu_eaKZxQ/", "webpage_url_basename": "Dfgu_eaKZxQ", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/899340458_18148776415570984_1640002502426816968_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyNjQyNDczODk4Njk1NzkwNA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=4Vv5aShK3Y8Q7kNvwHO7ptL&_nc_oc=AdrrDpFsbdBxBMxLjh8ebZvzDri2gc2QKB9CUE9KzMIPaE_8iPmNnypva7GSd_V62DIjS82jA2RV-2yULSsni59R&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna&_nc_gid=tL5DRRWrTOYlEWM8EDqbQA&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQStrSz4K47A2Q6IOQDGVripXP_zaImItsmQ9NRx7cyR7w&oe=6AF82C7A", "display_id": "Dfgu_eaKZxQ", "fulltitle": "Video by mythospaths", "upload_date": "20261109", "epoch": 1794262332, "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPSYAvYSy4XOHYgGGJhPXeuHnfk